# The cottage undone while she is inside at night (Q3-06): she is out again at once and on her
# way to her bedroll, not "inside" nothing until morning.
set unlock all
set season summer
set time 0.3
place cottage @32,26 0
set camera 31 28 2
fast 20
set time 0.70
fast 90 actor laeticia inside
key ctrl+z
wait 2
expect count cottage 0
fast 10
expect visible laeticia 1
quit
